  m_text: 'The UVs place the texture on the surface, and Tiling repeats it. A tileable texture continues seamlessly across its edges; a unique picture does not.


    <b>Predict:</b> Set Tiling to 2 on A and on B: which still looks like one continuous surface? Why are the bricks on D wider than on C?


    <b>Try:</b> Change Tiling on the materials of A and B. Then give D a Tiling that makes its bricks the same size as on C.'
