  m_text: 'A texture is a grid of pixels. More pixels look sharper up close, but weigh more in memory and in the project.


    <b>Predict:</b> The three panels show the same photo at different sizes. Which has the most pixels? Which has the fewest?


    <b>Try:</b> Move the Scene view close to each panel. Then select each texture and read its Max Size and the size shown under its preview.'
