  m_text: 'The Base Map should hold only the surface''s own colour, with no light and no shadow painted in. The lights in the scene add those.


    <b>Predict:</b> There are pole shadows on the wall. One of them is painted into the texture. Move the Spot Light: which one stays where it is?


    <b>Try:</b> Select Spot Light - move me and move it. Then open the wall''s Base Map texture in the Project window.'
