  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The Lit shader takes a texture for each of its main inputs: Base Map, Normal Map, Metallic Map (with smoothness in its alpha), Occlusion Map and Emission Map.


    <b>Predict:</b> Which step makes the grout lines look recessed? Which makes the tiles shine and the grout dull?


    <b>Try:</b> Open material 4 and remove its maps one at a time. Watch what changes on the sphere and on the slab.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Textured materials, Floors (Pool tiles)</color></size>'
